Subject: config.sub: accept substrate as an OS name

Standard one-line config.sub registration so triples like
i386-unknown-substrate are recognised at configure time.

---
--- a/build-aux/config.sub	2026-09-27 23:27:36.326316802 -0500
+++ b/build-aux/config.sub	2026-09-27 23:27:37.269319226 -0500
@@ -2115,6 +2115,7 @@
 	| solidbsd* \
 	| sortix* \
 	| storm-chaos* \
+	| substrate* \
 	| sunos \
 	| sunos[34]* \
 	| superux* \
